#### pub fn [init\_cache](#method.init_cache)(cache\_size: [NonZero](https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/num/nonzero/struct.NonZero.html "struct core::num::nonzero::NonZero")<[usize](https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/std/primitive.usize.html)\>)

Available on **crate feature `layout-cache`** only.

Initialize an empty cache with a custom size. The cache is keyed on the layout and area, so that subsequent calls with the same parameters are faster. The cache is a `LruCache`, and grows until `cache_size` is reached.

By default, the cache size is [`Self::DEFAULT_CACHE_SIZE`](../prelude/struct.Layout.html#associatedconstant.DEFAULT_CACHE_SIZE "associated constant ratatui::prelude::Layout::DEFAULT_CACHE_SIZE").

