This method requires the number of constraints to be known at compile time. If you don’t know the number of constraints at compile time, use [`Layout::split_with_spacers`](../prelude/struct.Layout.html#method.split_with_spacers "method ratatui::prelude::Layout::split_with_spacers") instead.

